  "title": "ForgotPasswordPage selectChannel always sets step to 'phone' for both OTP and email channels",
  "description": "R6 deep audit finding. Dimension: Business Logic. Severity: P0. Source SHA: bbd487a3. Scope: R6_DEEP_AUDIT_WAVE. The selectChannel function, which handles the user's choice between OTP reset and email reset, always calls setStep('phone') regardless of which channel is selected. When the user clicks 'Reset via Email', they are incorrectly taken to the phone/OTP entry step instead of the email entry step. This completely breaks the email reset flow from the channel selection screen. NOTE: This needs verification by reading the actual selectChannel function body (around line 306) - if the function has been fixed since the partial read, this may be resolved.",
